            "paragraph": "In the World Ocean, densest waters found on the continental shelves induce density driven downsloping currents that can influence the deep ocean water masses properties. This process is poorly represented in z-coordinate ocean models, especially in Ocean General Circulation Model (OGCM) with coarse resolution in both horizontal and vertical directions.",
